   "sample": "s-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:90%\">\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><br><strong>Big Bus Tours is an official partner of TKTS Times Square! All riders are invited to use our Fast Pass lane. Just show your Big Bus Tours ticket stub to a Patron Services Rep. </strong>Blackout dates apply.</h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"tkts-tabbed-booths\" data-tkts-tabs><ul class=\"tab-labels\" role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"tabbed content\"><li class=\"tab-label active\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" aria-controls=\"tkts-tab-times-square\" tabindex=\"0\">Times Square, NY <span class=\"tab-status tab-status--closed\">Closed</span></li><li class=\"tab-label\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" aria-controls=\"tkts-tab-lincoln-center\" tabindex=\"0\">Lincoln Center, NY <span class=\"tab-status tab-status--closed\">Closed</span></li><li class=\"tab-label tab-label__external\"><a class=\"tab-link tab-link--manual\" href=\"http://philadelphia.tkts.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Philadelphia, PA <span class=\"tab-status tab-status--closed\">Closed</span></a></li><li class=\"tab-label tab-label__external\"><a class=\"tab-link tab-link--manual\" href=\"http://london.tkts.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">London, England <span class=\"tab-status tab-status--closed\">Closed</span></a></li><li class=\"tab-label tab-label__external\"><a class=\"tab-link tab-link--manual\" href=\"http://japan.tkts.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Tokyo, Japan <span class=\"tab-status tab-status--closed\">Closed</span></a></li></ul><div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"tab-panel\" role=\"tabpanel\" tabindex=\"0\" id=\"tkts-tab-times-square\">        <section class=\"tkts tkts--booth\">\n            <div class=\"tkts__header tkts__cols\">\n                <div class=\"tkts__col tkts__col--main\">\n                    <h2 class=\"tkts__title\"><span class=\"tkts__title-tkts\">TKTS</span> Times Square</h2>\n                                                <p class=\"tkts__address\">Broadway at W 47th St, New York NY 10036</p>\n                                            <div class=\"tkts__notice tkts__notice--closed\">\n                                                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" stroke-width=\"1\" fill=\"var(--global-pure-white)\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\"><path d=\"M165.66,101.66,139.31,128l26.35,26.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32L128,139.31l-26.34,26.35a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L116.69,128,90.34,101.66a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L128,116.69l26.34-26.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32ZM232,128A104,104,0,1,1,128,24,104.11,104.11,0,0,1,232,128Zm-16,0a88,88,0,1,0-88,88A88.1,88.1,0,0,0,216,128Z\"></path></svg>\n                                                <div class=\"tkts__notice-container\">\n                            The Times Square booth is currently closed until Monday 3:00 PM. These shows were on the board recently.                        </div>\n                    </div>\n\n                                            <div class=\"tkts__hours-wrap\">            <div class=\"tkts__hours\">\n                <h3 class=\"is-style-heading-4\">Operational Hours</h3>\n                <ul class=\"tkts__hours-list\">\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Monday:</strong>\n                                                    3:00 PM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Tuesday:</strong>\n                                                    3:00 PM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Wednesday:</strong>\n                                                    11:00 AM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Thursday:</strong>\n                                                    11:00 AM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Friday:</strong>\n                                                    3:00 PM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Saturday:</strong>\n                                                    11:00 AM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                    <li>\n                        <strong>Sunday:</strong>\n                                                    11:00 AM &#8211; 8:00 PM                                            </li>\n                                </ul>\n            </div>\n            </div>\n                                                                            <div class=\"tkts__special-hours\">\n                                    <div class=\"tkts__special-hours-group\">\n                                                    <h4 class=\"tkts__special-hours-heading is-style-heading-5 is-pure-white-color\">Thanksgiving Week Schedule</h4>\n                                                                            <ul class=\"tkts__special-hours-list\">\n                                                                    <li>\n                                        <strong>Monday, November 23, 2026:</strong>\n                                        3:00 PM – 8:00 PM                                    </li>\n                                                                    <li>\n                                        <strong>Tuesday, November 24, 2026:</strong>\n                                        3:00 PM – 8:00 PM                                    </li>\n                                                                    <li>\n    