   "sample": "ure>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:90%\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>TKTS Accessibility Policy</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Our TKTS Patron Services Representatives and ticket sellers are happy to assist people with disabilities. We can assist people with mobility, vision and auditory concerns in a variety of ways. Let us know if you have questions about what accommodations are available at the TKTS Booth as well as the theatre you&#8217;re visiting.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:64px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n<div\n    id=\"farlo-ui-colour-block-block_e5ab9bfd6e5283e9c6d2e1987cc6265e\"\n    class=\"farlo-ui-colour-block is-style-global-pure-white-background alignfull\">\n            <div class=\"site__wrapper\">\n    \n        <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" data-reveal-sequence=\"1\" data-reveal-base=\"100\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Helpful Tips</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you have any questions or need help while at the booth, find one of our TKTS Patron Services Representatives! They are available to help you with whatever you need and can be spotted wearing red TKTS shirts or jackets.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">View more tips</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Payment Info</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">All TKTS locations accept Visa, Mastercard, American Express and Discover cards, cash and TKTS eGift Cards. A handful of Off-Broadway shows require cash only. All tickets are subject to a $8 per ticket service charge, which helps support other TDF services and programs. Additional non-TDF service charges may apply to some tickets.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Fast Pass</strong></h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">TKTS 7-Day Fast Pass allows TKTS patrons to return to the Times Square ticket booth within seven days of their TKTS purchase and walk up to the Fast Pass lane with their TKTS ticket stubs, thereby avoiding the line.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n            </div>\n    \n    </div>\n\n\n<div \n    id=\"farlo-ui-social-media-block_06ca7bf03547780846f0a1ff89e0f011\" \n    class=\"farlo-ui-social-media is-style-tertiary alignfull is-style-heading-4 \" \n    style=\" --font-colour: var(--global-pure-white);\"\n    >\n            <div class=\"site__wrapper\">\n    \n            <div class=\"farlo-ui-social-media__header \">\n                        <span class=\"farlo-ui-social-media__title\">\n                TKTS on Social Media            </span>\n        </div>\n    \n        <div class=\"farlo-ui-social-icons\">\n        <ul class=\"farlo-ui-social-icons__list\" role=\"list\">\n                            <li class=\"farlo-ui-social-icons__list-item\">\n                    <a class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon farlo-ui-social-icons__icon-facebook\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/OfficialTKTS\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">\n                        <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n                            Visit us on Facebook                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon-span\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                            <svg class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon-svg\" focusable=\"false\">\n                                <use xlink:href=\"#farlo-ui-social-icons__icon-facebook\"></use>\n                            </svg>\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                            <li class=\"farlo-ui-social-icons__list-item\">\n                    <a class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon farlo-ui-social-icons__icon-instagram\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/tkts/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">\n                        <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n                            Visit us on Instagram                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon-span\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                            <svg class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon-svg\" focusable=\"false\">\n                                <use xlink:href=\"#farlo-ui-social-icons__icon-instagram\"></use>\n                            </svg>\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                            <li class=\"farlo-ui-social-icons__list-item\">\n                    <a class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon farlo-ui-social-icons__icon-tiktok\" href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@tktsnyc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">\n                        <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">\n                            Visit us on TikTok                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon-span\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n                            <svg class=\"farlo-ui-social-icon__icon-svg\" focusable=\"false\">\n                                <use xlink:href=\"#farlo-ui-social-icons__icon-tiktok\"></use>\n                            </svg>\n                        </span>\n                    </a>\n                </li>\n                    </ul>\n    </div>\n    \n            </div>\n    </div>\n\n\n\n<div \nid=\"farlo-ui-background-block_1f5ab1d4f285aadb08fcdd94fe29a159\" \nclass=\"farlo-ui-background alignfull farlo-ui-background__full-height\"\nstyle=\"\"\n>\n            <div class=\"farlo-ui-background__image\">\n                        <img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"460\" src=\"https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-1024x460.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-1024x460.jpeg 1024w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-300x135.jpeg 300w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-768x345.jpeg 768w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-1536x690.jpeg 1536w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-1000x449.jpeg 1000w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-1600x718.jpeg 1600w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-600x269.jpeg 600w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-512x230.jpeg 512w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg-100x45.jpeg 100w, https://www.tdf.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/discount-bg.jpeg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" />        </div>\n                <div class=\"site__wrapper\">\n            <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">/</p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-8f761849 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\" data-reveal-sequence=\"1\" data-reveal-base=\"100\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\" style=\"flex-basis:66.66%\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-secondary-text-colour-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-11\">Why Should I Get My Last-Minute <strong>Discount Tickets at TKTS?</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-secondary-text-colour-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-12 wp-block-paragraph\">Everyone knows that purchasing tickets at TKTS is the best way to get affordable tickets to Broadway and Off-Broadway shows. TKTS has been in Times Square for more than 50 years, offering the widest selection of discount tickets. When you purchase tickets at TKTS, you know your seat locations and kno",
